left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

:Client: as Client
:System Admin: as SysAdmin
:Financial Advisor: as FAFD

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  
  Client --> (SFR012) : generates client dashboards that present financial information in an intuitive and actionable format.
  Client --> (SFR013) : generates client alerts based on predefined conditions to ensure timely notification of important financial events.
  Client --> CFR002
  Client --> SAFR005
  Client --> FAFD --> (FAFR004)
  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001
  
  Financial Advisor --> (SFR016) : generates predictive insights from the AI component to enhance the value of financial guidance provided to clients.
  Financial Advisor --> (AIFR009) : generate client predictive intervention recommendations by identifying patterns that indicate potential financial difficulties or opportunities requiring advisor engagement.
  
  Client --> CFR011
}

@enduml